 - 2026-06-28: PHASE B1 (INFRA slot 1; ADVERSARIAL CHECK) -- VERIFY the A1 env-grounded-search result is HONEST: the change-VALUE used in the search came from the REAL ENV (executed transitions), NOT predicted or leaked from the banked answer; the change-LOCATION prior was the induced model (not the oracle); the search was planner-BLIND to the banked winning prefix; live-path-reachable; oracle-distinct; ran live on GPU0; the per-game (first-win x action-cost x migration) numbers MATCH the fork verdict. ALSO verify A1b GENUINELY RAN LIVE (duration_s>60, NOT DURATION_TOO_SHORT) on the SAME held-out split, oracle-distinct -- or record it gate-skipped. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete_a1_a1b_audited; results/experiment_4908_env_grounded_search_audit.json
 - 2026-06-28: PHASE B2 (INFRA slot 2; DEADLINE-RELEVANT) -- SUBMISSION-PACKAGE FINAL harden: re-verify the Kaggle ARC-AGI-3 agent package builds + the frozen Qwen3.5-9B-MTP stack loads under ~16GB; produce the FINAL OPERATOR submission checklist (NEVER submits). The package was READY in .451 (vram ~15.146GB); the deadline is 6/30 (~2 days out) so this is the final pre-deadline go/no-go confirmation. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=success_submission_package_ready_final_pre_deadline; results/experiment_4909_submission_package_harden.json
